# Native iOS shell — create on a Mac with Xcode (P3):
#
#   npx cap add ios
#   npm run ios:sync
#   npx cap open ios
#
# Attach storekit/Products.storekit to the Xcode scheme
# (Edit Scheme → Run → Options → StoreKit Configuration).
#
# Then follow:
#   store/ASC_SETUP.md
#   store/SCREENSHOTS.md
#   store/SUBSCRIPTION_TESTS.md
